{"id": "EUVD-2026-108686", "enisaUuid": "046822d0-44e5-376a-a19e-92956af381c3", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nfirmware: arm_scmi: Validate BASE_ERROR_EVENT payload size\n\nBASE_ERROR_EVENT carries a variable number of message reports,\nwith the count encoded in error_status. The notification parser used\nthat count without checking whether the received payload contained all\nreported entries.\n\nReject truncated payloads before copying the report array.", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T12:31:37", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T12:31:37", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4a754704698017ced0b657c92b468035faad00ed", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/28d65a0a46435d48b96b6943c518095dff1602a1", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/890a9c3bf9dae90dcabded9d8e10c708a13779f7", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c0742f23ec13fb6f5e0cd884323467a6c127d3c2", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bd8bc95ef2daa3bac56197cffcbf2d4c5ed42216", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cb77a50d1114c0c9e084176301a8e094d383edfa", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/56e7e64cdd0e7209a58c8ec66028d63387402919", "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-98892"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98892", "GHSA-73qm-h5pg-gqfm"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "012e38a9-bb5d-39d8-9550-d69eefa207e2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.111"}, {"id": "02db2896-757f-3c4e-94fc-9054aeb24a03", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <bd8bc95ef2daa3bac56197cffcbf2d4c5ed42216"}, {"id": "2176ae57-b342-3200-8c6b-3b75223effa3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "2f6f96cb-8f47-36f9-8827-33812a7b8512", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <28d65a0a46435d48